- The last occurrence wins. So if I see `-H -h`, the result is "off". If I see `-h -H`, the result is "on".
- For standard input: if forced on → prefix with `(standard input):`, if forced off → no prefix, if default → no prefix (standard input has no prefix by default)
- For files: if forced on → always prefix, if forced off → never prefix, if default → prefix only if ≥2 files

