- If I see `-h` (short or long `--no-filename`), set mode to `ForceOff`
- Any other short option letter → error
- `--` ends option parsing

For the prefix logic:
- `ForceOn`: always prefix
- `ForceOff`: never prefix
- `Default`: prefix if files.len() >= 2 (for stdin, never prefix)

